title: FIRST_Tell
---
Mom: We call it 북두칠성 (Bukdu Chilseong), the seven stars of the northern sky.
Mom: I prayed for your health, for longevity, and for your happiness.
Mom: And you lived.
Mom: I don’t know what I’d do without you.
Mom: You are the light of my life. The center of my world. My guiding star.
	-> I wanted to tell you something.
